      "content": "it just feels like if i don't exist in their records, i don't actually exist at all. it's like i'm being erased bit by bit. i wake up every day and i'm just... waiting for the next error message or the next rejection letter. what is even the point of trying to stay in a world that clearly wants you gone?",
